<title>FINLAND: Finnish April industrial output up 7.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish April industrial output up 7.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days increased 7.9 percent year-on-year in April compared to an 8.8 percent rise in March, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>		   April 1997   March 1997   April 1996</p>
<p>		    +7.9 pct     +8.8 pct    +0.9 pct</p>
<p>The average of six economists' forecasts was for a growth rate of 9.2 percent (range 8.2-10.0 percent).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358-0-680 50 245, news@reuters@.fi</p>
